     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<br><br>I have some code that broke when I updated to dplyr 0.5.0:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">d </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&lt;&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">select_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">distinct_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&lt;&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">select_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">distinct_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lazy_dots</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dots</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  argument </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;.dots&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missing</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">with</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">no</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">default</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>The following code works:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">d </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">select_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">distinct_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dots </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>Is this an intentional change or an unintended consequence of other changes to distinct?<br><br>Thanks<br><br>Ross<br><br><br><br><br></div>"
